    "Scan of the 1950 edition of the Ivanhoe, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1924; aerial photographs from 1946; field checked in 1950; last revised in 1950; printed in 1952.",
